# godzilla_le 1.16 - DRAFTED by port_tool.py from godzilla_pro-1.15.port, then proven (item 135).
# Every address moved from Pro 1.15. In the emulator on this build (card
# godzilla_le-1_16_0_spike2) the runtime matched all 24 functions, armed with every
# capability, and template_mode.c ran unchanged: started on three Maser shots, scored both
# ramps by name, ended on time. A shot census pressed every playfield switch.
# UNVERIFIED on this build, and marked where they are: the struct offsets no run exercised
# (lights, screens, award screen).
# Callouts heard in the emulator 2026-09-24 (item 163): countdown, ten_seconds, time_up.
game           godzilla_le
version        1.16

# ---- functions: site <name> <address> <first two instruction words> --------------------
