# ---- shots: shot <mask> <name> - from the census on this build (switch ids from its own table) ----
shot 0x00100000    Left ramp
shot 0x00200000    Right ramp
shot 0x00400000    Building
shot 0x00080000    Godzilla target
shot 0x08000000    Maser target
shot 0x10000000    Powerline left
shot 0x20000000    Powerline center
shot 0x40000000    Powerline right
# LE has THREE shield targets; Pro 1.15's "Shield target right" bit is LE's centre one
shot 0x80000000    Shield target left
shot 0x100000000   Shield target center
shot 0x200000000   Shield target right
shot 0x400000000   Skill shot
shot 0x1000000000  Big loop
# on LE only, or new to the census
shot 0x2           Slingshot
shot 0x4           Left return lane
shot 0x10          Right return lane
shot 0x40          Pop bumper
shot 0x10000000000 Mecha exit bottom
# The three spinners each send THREE bits a spin, one dispatch each (0x80 0x200 0x400 /
# 0x800 0x2000 0x4000 / 0x8000 0x20000 0x40000); the MIDDLE bit is the one the game's own
# rules test (Ebirah's spin counts, item 158, emulator-proven), so it is the spinner's shot
# here (item 160). Mecha exit top, Building exit and the VUK send only 0x1.
shot 0x200         Left spinner
shot 0x2000        Top spinner
shot 0x20000       Shield ramp spinner

