# ---- the magnet: a grab of the mode's own (PAD-381; pad_mode_runtime.c "the magnet") - LE 1.16 (found from Pro 1.16 by code, movw/movt and branch fields masked).
# coil_fire = ControlCoil's fire (device, pulse power, pulse ms, hold power, hold ms, x ms): one command
# the board ends by itself; all zeros = OFF (cmd 4d). adjustment = read one adjustment (ids: magnet_adj_*
# default to the LO set 363-366 and DISABLED 343, the same on Pro and LE 1.16). proc_exists = is a game
# process alive; magnet_procs = the game's own magnet processes (a mode never grabs while one runs, and
# steps aside when one starts). magnet_get = the GodzillaMagnet object, its device at +4 = magnet_dev.
site coil_fire             0x003e8c78 0xe3500000 0xe52de004
site adjustment            0x002b3614 0xe92d40f0 0xe2504000
