# out): how many light channels it moved, the most at once, for how long. show_kind_<n>: flashy (a mode's start),
# subdued (its end), accent (a moment); show_secs_<n>: how long the runtime lets it play - one that runs until
# stopped (process 315's body) is stopped there. Left out: 326's body (67 channels for under 2 s), 332's and 333's
# (next to nothing), and the attract director's 0x1cf458 and 0x1d47a8 (they run until stopped, and 0x1d47a8 throws
